snp1.2:13.1 starts: The great cloud rained down
snp1.2:13.2 starts: filling the lowlands & high.
snp1.2:13.3 starts: Hearing the rain-god pour down,
snp1.2:13.4 starts: Dhaniya said:
snp1.3:14.1 starts: Seeing radiant bracelets of gold,
snp1.3:14.2 starts: clinking, clashing,
snp1.3:14.3 starts: two on an arm,
snp1.3:14.4 starts: wander alone
